    "cases": [
      "140-function acyclic chain solved callee-first, beyond old graph and iteration bounds.",
      "300-function recursive SCC remains terminal with exact SCC size/ordinals, no 8-bit saturation.",
      "Existing native body-bound/unknown-call refusals, deep chain, independent target admission, self recursion, mutual recursion and unknown callee in an SCC."
