  "replacement": [
    "Removed128-node graph admission gate, dense adjacency/transitive closure and capped repeated whole-graph summary passes.",
    "Shared accepted CFG successor rules build a sparse direct graph; each section offset index is built once and reused across roots. Graph traversal does not stop at an unsupported register transfer and hide later direct edges.",
    "Iterative SCC processing is O(V+E) in graph storage/edge visits. Nonrecursive components are solved callee-first; cyclic components remain terminal. No raised body or convergence cap.",
    "SCC size/ordinal fields widened to32-bit integer representation; JSON field names/meaning unchanged. Legacy terminal enum values remain readable historical vocabulary."
  ],
